    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this step",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Follow this group when catchup reads are active. Compare read_next success/error and backend read latency. A blocking read_next includes waiting for new data; a large duration alone does not prove a slow disk. EOF/end_of_file at the tail is an expected outcome. Per-reader read-frontier metrics are not exported by the example's WP v0.1.46; inspect wp log readers when needed."
      },
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "WP reader read_next by result",
      "description": "P50/P95/P99 of observed operations; no observations produce no data/NaN. Check the stage's observation rate. Quantiles from different stages cannot be added or subtracted. Values above the largest finite histogram bucket cannot be resolved accurately.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le,pod,log_id,status) (rate(woodpecker_client_reader_operation_latency_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",woodpecker_id=\"$woodpecker_id\",component!=\"woodpecker\",log_ns=~\"${log_ns:regex}\",log_id=~\"${log_id:regex}\",operation=\"read_next\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50 · {{pod}} · {{log_id}} · {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le,pod,log_id,status) (rate(woodpecker_client_reader_operation_latency_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",woodpecker_id=\"$woodpecker_id\",component!=\"woodpecker\",log_ns=~\"${log_ns:regex}\",log_id=~\"${log_id:regex}\",operation=\"read_next\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 · {{pod}} · {{log_id}} · {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le,pod,log_id,status) (rate(woodpecker_client_reader_operation_latency_bucket{cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",woodpecker_id=\"$woodpecker_id\",component!=\"woodpecker\",log_ns=~\"${log_ns:regex}\",log_id=~\"${log_id:regex}\",operation=\"read_next\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99 · {{pod}} · {{log_id}} · {{status}}"
        }
      ],
